[Options]
[A.]
<h2>~lRun Like ~4Hell~. 2</h2>
R U Up 2 This?<br>
Read the notes.<br>
$Menu=I want the notes,Tell,Info
$Menu=I don't wanna,Tell,HellNoNo

[HellNoNo]
Have it your way.
$Button=I will be that way,Tell,Info1

[Info]
<h2>Notes:</h2><br>
You don't have any powers for 15 minutes.  I suppose you could build a temple and wait it out, but please don't.  It takes the elements of this cool map.<br>
Have fun getting past those barricades.  Unless you are really good, you won't win.<br>
If you need help/hints, e-mail me.  But it isn't all that hard.
$Button=OK,Tell,HaHa

[Info1]
<h2>Notes:</h2><br>
Too bad, here they are.<br>
You don't have any powers for 20 some minutes.  I suppose you could build a temple and wait it out, but please don't.  It takes the elements of this cool map.<br>
Have fun getting past those barricades.  You don't have to be good at NS to win, just know the properties of the game.<br>
If you need help/hints, e-mail me.  But it isn't all that hard.
$Button=OK,Tell,HaHa1

[HaHa1]
Wait, there's more (goody).<br>
There are some stuff that needs attention.<br>
Some are immediate, others can be put off for a FEW SECONDS.  Heeheehe.<br>
<i>"No one ever said it would be easy..." -Unknown<i>
$Menu=Hey...it's only your priest's life,Tell,Haha

[HaHa]
Have Fun +<br>
Good Luck<br>
The Virtuous Warrior<br>
$Button=Cool,DoNothing,0

[@3]
<$MoveDialog,tm>
Incoming message from ~lSpell Master~w:<br>
I used a spell to capture enemy bridges... But it produced side effects.<br>
The bridges are falling down!<br>
It is one of the ways out.  We need to find a hardening spell, quick!<br>
Also, while I was in my spell trance, I decided to test out my new spell, permenant paralysis.  I didn't work, but it did somehow freeze the priests!<br>
Ain't I a good ally?<br>
<$ViewSpot,(144x60)>
$Button=Ok...I'll hurry,Tell,Runlikehell

